        "original_id": "395b2695-9851-51cc-bf1b-13c280ba88f0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: In Love and War (1987 film), Split Image\n- People: James Woods, Jane Alexander, James Stockdale, Sybil Stockdale, Steven Vincent Leigh, Ted Kotcheff, Michael O'Keefe, Karen Allen, Peter Fonda, Elizabeth Ashley, Brian Dennehy, Ronnie Scribner\n- Roles: United States Navy vice admiral, aviator, American prisoner of war\n- Concepts: Vietnam War, Medal of Honor, true story, television film\n\nFacts:\n- James Bond Stockdale was a United States Navy vice admiral and aviator who received the Medal of Honor for his service in the Vietnam War and was held as an American prisoner of war for more than seven years during that war.\n- In 1987, In Love and War was released as a Vietnam War-based thriller-drama television film starring James Woods and Jane Alexander.\n- In Love and War was based on the true story of James Stockdale and Sybil Stockdale.\n- In 1987, Steven Vincent Leigh appeared in the film In Love and War.\n- Split Image was directed by Ted Kotcheff and starred Michael O'Keefe, Karen Allen, Peter Fonda, James Woods, Elizabeth Ashley, Brian Dennehy, and Ronnie Scribner.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
